# Generated art and audio. The scripts in build/ are the source of truth and
# their output is deterministic, so the binaries stay out of history.
#
# Consequence worth knowing before you touch the release workflow: the BigWigs
# packager skips anything git is ignoring, so building these into Duskfall/ is
# NOT enough to get them into the zip. The workflow force-adds them. Dropping
# that step produces a release that installs cleanly with no rain and no sound.
*.tga
*.ogg
build/rain-preview.png

# Packager output.
.release/

# Local research artifacts, never committed.
listfile/
probe-results/

# Python bytecode. tools/probe.cpython-312.pyc was tracked by accident.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
